            <p>Perioral Dermatitis,&#x000a0;Perioral dermatitis is a benign eruption that occurs most commonly in young, female adults, consisting of small inflammatory papules and pustules or pink, scaly patches around the mouth. <ext-link xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://dermnetnz.org/images">DermNet New Zealand</ext-link></p>
